{"id":"0539a14219495918","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-ef-game-fo.md","title":"EF游戏刻画定理","display":"thm-ef-game-fo — EF游戏刻画定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-ef-game-fo","aliases":["29-thm-ef-game-fo"],"display":"thm-ef-game-fo — EF游戏刻画定理","depends_on":["[[29-df-ef-game]]","[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","[[29-df-n-equivalence]]","[[29-df-struc]]","[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","[[29-df-sentence]]","[[29-df-satisfaction]]"],"source_locator":"Theorem 6.10, p.95, DjVu scan 110","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及量化秩归纳证明已核对"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-ef-game-fo"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-ef-game-fo</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ef-game-fo — EF游戏刻画定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"33e3bd9a5bf15557\" href=\"?note=33e3bd9a5bf15557\" title=\"29-df-n-equivalence\">29-df-n-equivalence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 6.10, p.95, DjVu scan 110"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述及量化秩归纳证明已核对"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\">\\(\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}\\)</span> 为有限关系词汇，可含常量，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"44836019093a45c6\" href=\"?note=44836019093a45c6\" title=\"29-df-relational-vocab\">29-df-relational-vocab</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\">\\(\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4de8e0c8085801f5\" href=\"?note=4de8e0c8085801f5\" title=\"29-df-struc\">29-df-struc</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_n\">\\(\\equiv_n\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"33e3bd9a5bf15557\" href=\"?note=33e3bd9a5bf15557\" title=\"29-df-n-equivalence\">29-df-n-equivalence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"c5e364d61e491828\" href=\"?note=c5e364d61e491828\" title=\"29-df-ef-game\">29-df-ef-game</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"711217f22972ffc0\" href=\"?note=711217f22972ffc0\" title=\"29-df-sentence\">29-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" href=\"?note=5a04c13fd73e2c1c\" title=\"29-df-quantifier-rank\">29-df-quantifier-rank</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}game\\text{-}fo}\\vdash\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\bigl(A\\equiv_nB\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}game\\text{-}fo}\\vdash\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\bigl(A\\equiv_nB\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}game\\text{-}fo}\\vdash\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\Bigl(A\\not\\equiv_nB\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\land((A\\models\\varphi\\land B\\not\\models\\varphi)\\lor(A\\not\\models\\varphi\\land B\\models\\varphi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}game\\text{-}fo}\\vdash\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\Bigl(A\\not\\equiv_nB\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\land((A\\models\\varphi\\land B\\not\\models\\varphi)\\lor(A\\not\\models\\varphi\\land B\\models\\varphi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 6.10，印刷页 95、扫描页 110。取足够多的可用卵石与初始空变量位置，得到量化秩为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的句子等价；第二式同时展开不等价的定义。原书证明对量化秩归纳，使用有限关系词汇中有界秩类型的有限性。这里不把该论证无条件推广至含函数符号的无限结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"c5e364d61e491828","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ef-game]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-relational-vocab]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"33e3bd9a5bf15557","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-n-equivalence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-struc]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-relational-vocab","status":"resolved","id":"44836019093a45c6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$ 为有限关系词汇，可含常量，见 [[29-df-relational-vocab]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-struc","status":"resolved","id":"4de8e0c8085801f5","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$ (see [[29-df-struc]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-n-equivalence","status":"resolved","id":"33e3bd9a5bf15557","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\equiv_n$ (see [[29-df-n-equivalence]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ef-game","status":"resolved","id":"c5e364d61e491828","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)$ (see [[29-df-ef-game]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"711217f22972ffc0","anchor":"ref-12","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau$ (see [[29-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"5a04c13fd73e2c1c","anchor":"ref-13","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{qr}$ (see [[29-df-quantifier-rank]])","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-14","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\models$ (see [[29-df-satisfaction]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}game\\text{-}fo}\\vdash\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\bigl(A\\equiv_nB\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Duplicator}\\uparrow G_n(A,B)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ef\\text{-}game\\text{-}fo}\\vdash\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]\\;\\Bigl(A\\not\\equiv_nB\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_\\tau\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)\\leq n\\land((A\\models\\varphi\\land B\\not\\models\\varphi)\\lor(A\\not\\models\\varphi\\land B\\models\\varphi))\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]、[[29-thm-pebble-kvar]] — 博弈刻画"},{"id":"33e3bd9a5bf15557","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"原书 Definition 6.9，印刷页94–95、扫描页109–110。此处比较量词秩至多 $n$ 的闭句，和带初始赋值的公式等价区分。定义允许有限词汇中出现函数；[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]] 的游戏刻画另有限关系词汇前提，不因本条定义域较大而自动推广。"},{"id":"93bcfaaefa338233","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"07c3669c44551902","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\tau\\in\\mathrm{RelationalVocab}$；$A,B\\in\\mathrm{STRUC}[\\tau]$，见 [[29-thm-ef-game-fo]]。"},{"id":"75c22d8e0af45459","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"已阅读原书双向证明并核对其在本接口下的对应。若 Delilah 获胜，从 $A$ 中任一存在二阶句子的见证着色出发，她得到一个与之 $m$ 轮 EF 等价的 $B$ 着色；[[29-thm-ef-game-fo]] 保留矩阵真值。反向，对 $A$ 的任意着色，在有限关系词汇中选取该扩张结构的完整有界秩句子类型的有限合取，得到秩至多 $m$ 的特征句。单向保真给出 $B$ 中实现此特征句的着色，再由 FO 游戏定理得到回应策略。有界秩类型有限性可由有限原子式类型及逐秩量词类型递归得到；$m\\geq1$ 时可用 $\\forall x\\,x=x$ 表示空合取。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-184","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-ef-game-fo]]"}],"outgoing":["c5e364d61e491828","44836019093a45c6","33e3bd9a5bf15557","4de8e0c8085801f5","5a04c13fd73e2c1c","711217f22972ffc0","3ee556c64b16809b"]}